id: pm-fx0rcb
title: Compact unbundled runtime JavaScript while preserving SDK declarations and Sentry source maps
description: "The connected planning SDK additions bring the current npm pack projection to 20,030,898 bytes, exceeding the unchanged 20 MB base ceiling. Compact emitted unbundled JavaScript whitespace without renaming identifiers or bundling modules; retain declaration documentation and compose original TypeScript source maps for Sentry. Preserve all public exports, package paths, and existing artifact limits."
