resolution: "Compacted retained unbundled JavaScript whitespace during build finalization while preserving public declarations, runtime module paths and identifiers, bundled bytes, and composed original TypeScript source maps."
expected_result: The enlarged planning SDK must fit the existing package ceiling without removing public runtime files or weakening distribution checks.
actual_result: "Final base npm pack projection passes at 17836817 unpacked bytes and 1459 files against unchanged 20000000-byte and 1800-file limits, with zero packaged maps. Real execution, source-map composition, declaration/bundle preservation, idempotence, installed npm/Bun/MCP and packed npx/bunx acceptance passed."
