comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-07T06:53:27.314Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: inspected full all-status 2651-item corpus for artifact/minification/packlist/footprint lineages, refreshed open and in-progress lists, and fully read pm-998juj metadata and closure. That shipped item removed packaged maps and added the budget; no active item owns whitespace compaction of retained unbundled runtime outputs. This is a new measured budget regression found by the mandatory artifact gate."
  "2026-09-07T06:59:48.090Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: the new real-filesystem compaction test first failed because the implementation was absent, then passed with the finalizer. It executes the compacted export in a real Node process, checks function name preservation, verifies declaration and bundled bytes are untouched, verifies composed source maps retain original TypeScript content, and checks repeated compaction is stable. The live base artifact now passes at 17,835,166 unpacked bytes and 1459 files with zero packaged maps, against unchanged 20 MB and 1800-file limits. Installed npx/bunx and final release checks remain underway."
  "2026-09-07T07:23:02.997Z","harness:codex","Installed verification after compaction passed separate npm/Bun CLI, SDK, MCP, and terminal-exclusion acceptance; packed npx/bunx smoke also passed for all 13 bundled packages. All linked finalizer tests passed. A concurrently launched build interrupted consumers of dist during broad verification, so subsequent build-dependent gates are serialized; no product failure or passing broad run is inferred from that interrupted run."
  "2026-09-07T07:45:41.024Z","harness:codex","Local implementation verification: exact full-source coverage passed at 100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered counts (60671 lines, 63170 statements, 13078 functions, 47962 branches). The full run had one stale workspace-intent assertion; that expected text was synchronized, then all 55 contracts and aggregation acceptance tests passed. Full static quality, context-quality and 56 token surfaces, typecheck, linked tests, staged secret scan, latest-release compatibility migration, 88-command package dogfood, installed npm/Bun CLI/SDK/MCP acceptance, and packed npx/bunx smoke passed. Hosted exact-head review, merge, and publication remain separate delivery steps; no hosted or released state is claimed here."
